rm thing like that  like even in my head so I kind of wish I  didn't do that hadn't done that but I'm  probably too lazy to cut it out so what  are you gonna do I could cut it out but  cuz I'm lazy so it it works for the age  group but even you know speaking as a  parent it didn't hurt I liked that a  heck of a lot better than say Despicable  Me 3 which just felt like it was  absolutely scraping the bottom of the  barrel this actually feels like about as  organic a progressive progression of the  story for these characters was going to  be because it could very easily run into  what I consider to be the Shrek or the  Meet the Parents Meet the Fockers  franchise problems which is that because  the heart of the first one or two films  is the tension between characters who  are meant to come to terms with each  other by the end of it they keep having  contrived reasons to set that back to  zero for later films and usually by the  third one it's really painful and really  contrived and that's not as much the  case here even though we're still  focusing quite a bit on things that are  causing tension between Dracula and his  daughter Mavis at the same time they're  finding scenarios that don't feel as  contrived as these things usually do  it's a little contrived but it's not it  doesn't feel as regressive it doesn't  feel as a retrograde as these kinds of  moves do and that's just this admittedly  probably just made because the there's  still money potential in the name and  it's made to cash in on whatever  goodwill is left it's better than it  needed to be for what it is for what it  was designed to be and  and I can admire it for that even while  acknowledging that this is no great work  and I do not expect to this to show up  again when I do my top 10 at the end of  the year but it's good it's fun solid so  Hotel Transylvania 3 have you seen it  what did you think about it if you  haven't seen it what are your thoughts  on any of the films in the Hotel  Transylvania series so whatever your  thoughts are drop something down in the  comments let's talk about it there's all  that stuff to do that everybody on  YouTube does I do have a patreon page  links for that and all the other stuff  that we all do it's all down in the  description so until next time this  council is adjourned  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

